+## 4 Finish purchase compliance
+
+The source still has three publishing-capacity packs, one calendar month ad-free, and `ad_free_forever` as a non-consumable with a forever flag. The selected release offer replaces that permanent product with one year ad-free, paid once without automatic renewal. Production billing is unavailable; current EUR prices are simulator/catalogue values, not approved annual pricing or final localised checkout prices. See [commerce source](../../backend/bmt_backend/commerce.py) and [Store implementation](../../game/ui/store_page.gd). The annual replacement is not implemented by this drafting task.
