+| 7. Products/prices | **Annual duration now confirmed:** one year ad-free replaces the permanent offer and does not renew automatically. Annual price, other prices and remaining catalogue choices are still undecided. | Replace the actual forever SKU/flag with timed verified access and show the exact expiry. Existing simulator amounts are not approved annual/release prices. |
