+| 9. Translation | **Preferred method:** AI-assisted translation. Exact launch/support languages and final language/regional review remain unspecified. | Translate the full relevant package: terms, privacy, community rules, purchase/deletion/withdrawal notices, moderation/appeal messages and UI. Verify meaning, completeness, version alignment and actual language-choice flows. No assumption of a legally mandatory professional translator is made; AI output alone is not acceptance evidence. |
